# Local secrets/config
# appsettings.Development.json is COMMITTED on purpose -- it is non-secret local wiring
# (ports, service names, intervals) and it is how a fresh clone runs without guesswork.
# Real secrets go in .NET User Secrets (dotnet user-secrets), which live OUTSIDE the
# repo in ~/.microsoft/usersecrets/, or in .env for docker compose.
secrets.json

